      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added nonVpn for 2 reasons:\n- There is already a getDefaultNetwork above which returns NetworkAgentInfo.\n- I wanted to make it clear that this Network cannot be a VPN network (which I guess I could do it via javadoc comment).\n\nI will rename getDefaultNetwork -\u003e getDefaultNetworkAgentInfo (in the CL below), so I can have getDefaultNetwork that actually returns Network.",
